<title>USA: Times Mirror May ad revs up 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror May ad revs up 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co said Thursday that advertising revenues for its newspaper publishing group for the four weeks ended June 1 rose 6.9 percent from a year earlier, to $129.38 million from $121.04 million.</p>
<p>For the 22 weeks of the year to date, advertising revenues rose 6.9 percent from a year ago, to $683.19 million from $639.32 million.</p>
<p>The results for 1997 contained two fewer days than the 1996 results.</p>
